  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The distressed woman is mapped as the 'victim' in the text",
  "description": "The text 'this victimizes me' implies that the woman in the image is the one being victimized. The visual of her distressed expression and posture (holding her head) is mapped onto the textual concept of 'victim' to convey the meme's ironic self-deprecation about feeling overwhelmed or unfairly targeted by a situation. The mapping is established through the juxtaposition of her emotional state with the text, which explicitly labels her as the victim of the situation depicted on the laptop.",
